{"id":"wb-5-346","name":"潞泽会馆","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"潞泽会馆","text":"潞泽会馆，位于中国河南省洛阳市的一座清代建筑群，是山西省潞安府、‌泽州府两地的商人兴建的商帮活动场所及关帝庙，民国时期曾被用作潞泽中学，1948年后曾被洛阳地区公安局及洛阳地区公路段占用。1981年，潞泽会馆被移交洛阳文物部门，建立为豫西博物馆，1987年更名为洛阳民俗博物馆至今。2001年，潞泽会馆被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BD%9E%E6%B3%BD%E4%BC%9A%E9%A6%86","revisionId":94176255,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94176255","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/31d7e79c2864a4e5d7ee42e1.jpg","title":"20241215_Luze_Guild_Hall,_Luoyang_07.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241215_Luze_Guild_Hall,_Luoyang_07.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/20241215_Luze_Guild_Hall%2C_Luoyang_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Luze Guild Hall in Luoyang","width":320,"height":213}}